        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "- if a surplus is declared in the force adjustment universe from which the employee was assigned, the employee will be returned to his/her regular title for the period of the surplus. At the conclusion of the surplus, if the employee neither is laid off nor selects a voluntary option program, then the employee may be temporarily assigned back to the appropriate Coordinator title.",
